#: ../../source/config_parts.rst:452
msgid ""
"Create an opinionated alternative to the existing part by initializing some "
"of its parameters, and overriding any of its properties. For example, to "
"avoid passing the same set of parameters many times."
msgstr ""
"Crea una alternativa personalizada a la pieza existente inicializando "
"algunos de sus parámetros y anulando cualquiera de sus propiedades. Por "
